"The Span is an eight-kilometer bridge joining Apex in the north to F City in the south."
"Aimi Velra once drove across The Span at 200 km/h while under the Velras' Gloss luck chain."
"At Diwali, Wright barges on either side of the Span fire magic missiles and fireworks in turn."
"This volley between Apex and F City workshops is the island's most popular Diwali event."
"Crowds pack the Apex half of the Span to watch the volley."
